flowchart LR
  USER[浏览器 / 微信内置浏览器]
  LB[托管 LB / WAF / CDN]
  STATIC[静态前端 / CDN]
  API1[API 实例 1]
  API2[API 实例 2]
  WORKER[Background Worker 1..N]
  MIGRATE[独立 Migration Job / Flyway]
  MYSQL[(MySQL 高可用)]
  REDIS[(Redis)]
  OSS[(对象存储)]
  OBS[日志 / 指标 / 告警]

  USER --> LB
  LB --> STATIC
  LB --> API1
  LB --> API2
  API1 --> MYSQL
  API2 --> MYSQL
  WORKER --> MYSQL
  MIGRATE -. 发布步骤 .-> MYSQL
  API1 --> REDIS
  API2 --> REDIS
  WORKER --> REDIS
  API1 --> OSS
  API2 --> OSS
  WORKER --> OSS
  API1 --> OBS
  API2 --> OBS
